   "Card": {
    "description": "The snapshot fields, and ONLY the snapshot fields.\n\nThere is no ground_truth here and there is nowhere for one to appear: the\nmodel is closed over eight named fields, so even if a future query started\nselecting `*` from a table that had grown an answer column, this would refuse\nto carry it. §1 puts the reason plainly -- leak_check guards the line that a\ncard's answer must not be reachable, and an endpoint anyone with the port can\ncall is exactly where that line would break.",
    "properties": {
     "card_id": {
      "title": "Card Id",
      "type": "string"
     },
